# Project workflows

- Run `just --list` to discover canonical tasks.
- Prefer `just check` for full verification and `just docs-check` for
  documentation-only changes.
- Run `just examples-check` after workflow, generator, configuration, or
  example changes.
- Exercise the working-tree binary with `just run -- <arguments>`.
- Do not run state-changing `install`, `deploy-local`, `docs-deploy`,
  `xremap-generate`, or `service-*` recipes unless the user requested that
  operation.
- Update the justfile and its human documentation together.
